    verification markerTextWithoutMarkerHoldsStandupGate : Test { :>> id = "7c4ac00c-8280-4f96-96ff-bb82222deef2"; :>> title = "Sprint 665 standup gate"; :>> createdAt = "2026-09-11"; :>> createdBy = "claudeOpus5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::inspect; :>> procedureText = "Order: measure the tree first so the cutoffs are chosen against what is there (measure460.py: 151 auto-accepted, 104 marker-part, 10 prose hits of which 9 also carry a marker part); write the classifier and its two unit tests in deck.rs; the hold in cmd_record after the plan-cover check and before the D0337 marker check, with the header line in write.rs and its removal in rewrite_proposed_header; guard consent-scope with a text-level classifier consent_scope_of so the known cases are unit-testable without a tree; register in GUARD_NAMES (70 -> 71), run_one, guard-constraints.sysml, guards.md, control-map.sysml (EHZ3, EHZ7); the integration test against a scaffold; CLAUDE.md sec 4 doc-sync; record D0439 with the marker; then the verifier and recorder."; }
